[{"answer":"Hello, Trevor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hello, Stephanie.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/2.mp3"},{"answer":"You said you wanted to talk about the course I'm taking on literature for children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/3.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm thinking of doing it next year, but I'd like to find out more about it first.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/5.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, well, as you probably know, it's a one-year course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/6.mp3"},{"answer":"It's divided into six modules, and you have to take all of them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/7.mp3"},{"answer":"One of the most interesting ones, for me, at least,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/8.mp3"},{"answer":"was about the purpose of children's literature.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/9.mp3"},{"answer":"You mean, whether it should just entertain children or should be educational, as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, and whether the teaching should be factual - giving them information about the world - or ethical, teaching them values.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/11.mp3"},{"answer":"What's fascinating is that the writer isn't necessarily conscious of the message they're conveying.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/12.mp3"},{"answer":"For instance, a story might show a child who has a problem as a result of not doing what an adult has told them to do,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/13.mp3"},{"answer":"implying that children should always obey adults.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... I see what you mean.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/15.mp3"},{"answer":"That module made me realise how important stories are -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/16.mp3"},{"answer":"they can have a significant effect on children as they grow up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Actually, it inspired me to have a go at it myself, just for my own interest.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I know I can't compete with the really popular stories, like the Harry Potter books - they're very good,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and even young kids like my seven-year-old niece love reading them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm very interested in illustrations in stories.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that covered in the course?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, there's a module on pictures,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and how they're sometimes central to the story.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Mm.. that's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I remember some frightening ones I saw as a child and I can still see them vividly in my mind, years later!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Pictures can be so powerful, just as powerful as words.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I've always enjoyed drawing, so that's the field I want to go into when I finish the course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I bet that module will be really helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sure it will.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/30.mp3"},{"answer":"We also studied comics in that module,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/31.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'm not convinced of their value, not compared with books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/32.mp3"},{"answer":"One of the great things about words is that you use your imagination,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/33.mp3"},{"answer":"but with a comic you don't have to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/34.mp3"},{"answer":"But children are so used to visual input - on TV, video games, and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/35.mp3"},{"answer":"There are plenty of kids who wouldn't even try to read a book,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/36.mp3"},{"answer":"so I think comics can serve a really useful purpose.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/37.mp3"},{"answer":"You mean, it's better to read a comic than not to read at all?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I suppose you're right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I just think its sad when children don't read books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/40.mp3"},{"answer":"What about books for girls and books for boys?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Does the course go into that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, there's a module on it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/43.mp3"},{"answer":"For years, lots of stories, in English, at least, assumed that boys went out and did adventurous things","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/44.mp3"},{"answer":"and girls stayed at home and played with dolls.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I was amazed how many books were targeted at just one sex or the other.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course this reflects society as it is when the books are written.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/47.mp3"},{"answer":"That's true.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/48.mp3"},{"answer":"So it sounds as though you think it's a good course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Definitely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you been reading lots of children's stories, to help you decide whether to take the course?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. I've gone as far back as the late seventeenth century,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/52.mp3"},{"answer":"though I know there were earlier children's stories.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/53.mp3"},{"answer":"So does that mean you've read Perrault's fairy tales?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Cinderella, The Sleeping Beauty, and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/56.mp3"},{"answer":"They must be important, because no stories of that type had been written before,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/57-2024-11-27-17-14-25.mp3"},{"answer":"these were the first.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there's The Swiss Family Robinson.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I haven't read that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/60.mp3"},{"answer":"The English name makes it sound as though Robinson is the family's surname,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/61.mp3"},{"answer":"but a more accurate translation would be The Swiss Robinsons,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/62.mp3"},{"answer":"because it's about a Swiss family who are shipwrecked,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/63.mp3"},{"answer":"like Robinson Crusoe in the novel of a century earlier.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Well I never knew that!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you read Hoffmann's The Nutcracker and the Mouse King?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Wasn't that the basis for Tchaikovsky's ballet The Nutcracker?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/67.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/68.mp3"},{"answer":"It has some quite bizarre elements.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope you've read Oscar Wilde's The Happy Prince.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/70.mp3"},{"answer":"It's probably my favourite children's story of all time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh.. mine too!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/72.mp3"},{"answer":"And it's so surprising, because Wilde is best known for his plays,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/73.mp3"},{"answer":"and most of them are very witty, but The Happy Prince is really moving.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/74.mp3"},{"answer":"I struggled with Tolkien's The Lord of the Rings...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/75.mp3"},{"answer":"three long books, and I gave up after one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/76.mp3"},{"answer":"It's extremely popular, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, but whereas something like The Happy Prince just carried me along with it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/78.mp3"},{"answer":"The Lord of the Rings took more effort than I was prepared to give it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/79.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't find that - I love it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Another one I've read is War Horse.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes. It's about the First World War, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Hardly what you'd expect for a children's story.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly, but it's been very successful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you read any...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-4-part-3-2023-02-07-10-36-02/85.mp3"}]
